GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> ;
    narr:childCount "119"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "e3c75c2df1a4d6b8ce07850fdf733affe72074b3" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative argues a sequential four-site migration on the grounds that bounded friction beats concurrent risk. It opens with [a steering-group deadline forcing the cutover shape to be decided](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1) and [the four sites laid out, one flagged as the one nobody wants to touch](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_5). The mainline is [a flat refusal of parallel cutovers, even for the two small ones](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), argued as [contained pain at one desk versus an unbounded double cutover](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13) and [the rota-versus-compound reframing of the desk's objection](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_15). The second meeting adds [the supervisor arithmetic showing a double cutover would pull eight of eleven supervisors off the floor](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_11), sharpened into [risk reframed as arithmetic — the constraint that doesn't move](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_14), plus [a demand that a soak never be shortened because a date slipped](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28). The third meeting revises the number: [a retraction striking the two-week soak from the plan](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3), grounded in [the Dockside logs re-analysis showing the queue was measuring a retired weekly reconciliation job](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5) and [the revised one-week soak proposal](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9), with [the caveat that the new number is tight, not safe](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_15) and [the recovered time going into the Clyde buffer](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_18), ratified as [the formal note that the two-week soak is superseded](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20). A position node holds [the soak-duration basis question — contested: rejected by Tanya TeamOwner, who reads the one-week figure as as unmeasured as the two weeks was, since nobody has run a soak yet](narr:Position_PostGoLiveSoakDurationBasis), alongside [the sequencing-strategy position](narr:Position_SiteCutoverSequencingStrategy); a fresh review comment adds [the demand that the one-week soak name who signs off the second site before it starts](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30). An advisor pass adds [the endorsement to hold the sequence against pressure](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_4), [precedent from three programmes where big-bang went backwards](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_5), and [the directive to write down the reasons now, while calm](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_9). Review acts qualify the arc: [a requested-changes note that containment did not settle the sequencing](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_3), [a rejection asserting no single-site pilot was ever agreed and the call settled on two sites in parallel](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_4), against [an acceptance of the change toward the sequencing-strategy position](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_2).""" ;
    narr:reaction """The correction meeting has doubled in the graph: the same retraction-and-one-week exchange now also sits as review-comment expressions, including [Tina reopening at the top to correct her own two-week figure rather than burying it](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_19) and [the recorded rejection that the one-week figure is as unmeasured as the two weeks was](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_62). For you as reviewer, the soak-duration position's contested state is now carried by an anchored rejection quote rather than narration alone, while [the demand that the one-week soak name who signs off the second site](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30) stays the live open condition. The mainline arc itself did not move.""" ;
